# attempt(() => later.x); const later = { x: 1 }  in a file that is not checked, in a program where seventeen layouts have an `x`: the list is a guess and is forgotten as the program is read.
# That the binding holds nothing until its declaration has run is no guess. The mark of the dead zone stays in the type of the variable and of the field of the environment, and the test for it stays behind each read.
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: pipeline SimplifyCasts

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
