variable g0 name="later" module=m0 declared={type=absent|L0|L1|L2|L3|L4|L5|L6|L7|L8|L9|L10|L11|L12|L13|L14|L15|L16 flags=[IsExpected]} flags=[IsImmutable]

function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = NewClosure function=f1
    v1 = Call v0
    v2 = Integer integer=1
    v3 = NewObject -, v2, v2 layout=L0 fields=[0, 1]
    PutModuleVariable v3 variable=g0
    v5 = CallDirect function=f2
    v6 = CallDirect function=f2
    v7 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v8 = PropGet v7 key="publish" [isFreeName]
    v9 = Call v8, -, v1, v5, v6
    Return
}
function f1 name="readsVariable" kind=Arrow results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = GetModuleVariable variable=g0
    v1 = CheckInitialized v0 name="later"
    v2 = PropGet v1 key="x"
    Return v2
}
function f2 name="owner" results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = NewObject layout=L17
    v1 = NewClosure v0 function=f3
    v2 = Call v1
    v3 = Integer integer=2
    v4 = NewObject -, v3, v3 layout=L1 fields=[0, 1]
    PutEnvironmentField v0, v4 layout=L17 field=0
    Return v2
}
function f3 name="readsField" kind=Arrow captures=[{type=env L17}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: env L17):
    v1 = GetEnvironmentField v0 layout=L17 field=0
    v2 = CheckInitialized v1 name="local"
    v3 = PropGet v2 key="x"
    Return v3
}
